# App Python

Window and widgets do layout and signal wiring only. Carla I/O belongs in `services/` (`PatchController`, `CarlaOsc`, `MidiService`). Future MIDI recording goes in `services/midi.py`, not the UI.

Comment *why*, not the next line. Good targets: Carla param/rack indexes, MIDI program-change delays, touch `clearFocus`, stacked main vs split grids. Skip narration like “create a button”.

```python
# ❌ BAD
self.osc.set_active(idx, True)  # activate the plugin

# ✅ GOOD
# Mute the main instance so the PC hits only the split plugin.
self.osc.set_active(self.curr_main_carla_idx, False)
```
